              "text": "જવાબદારી (javābdārī) is built on javābdār, \"answerable\", with -ī (EtymDB). Javāb, \"answer\", is a loan from Arabic jawāb, root j-w-b (Lane), and -dār, \"holder\", is usually traced to Persian."
